    "breadcrumb": "CODAC \u003e Research thrusts",
    "content": "Leads: Brown and Fairbanks\nThe center’s work yields large-scale computational tools for specifying and solving complex engineering problems, and those tools need somewhere to live. A user-facing platform for implementing the results of the project is a requirement, not an afterthought.\nThis thrust builds that platform and uses it to distribute the methods to Air Force researchers and bench engineers. The research here includes developing domain-specific languages for the new composition paradigms and system specifications produced in the other thrusts. That is what keeps the center’s methods computationally tractable and usable on Air Force problems.",
